      "formula_unicode": "F⃗ = dP⃗/dt = C⃗(dm/dt) - V⃗(dm/dt) + m(dC⃗/dt) - m(dV⃗/dt)",
      "description": "宇宙大统一方程描述力的本质，统一了四种基本力",
      "icon": "🌌",
